                <pb facs="0611" n="561" xml:id="pg561"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Breckinridge.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-11-12"><hi rendition="#italic">November 12,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Yourself and others connected with legation are constituted a commission to
                    represent this Government at the obsequies of the late Czar.</p>
            </div>
